### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### get steps goal
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/steps/goal
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### set steps goal
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/steps/goal
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "goal": 10000
}

### get steps summary for a date range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/steps/summary?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-30
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
